      "writtenOn": "2020-04-23T01:26:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "libstatssocket is the concrete example. It\u0027s a library providing stable C API and is in the statsd APEX. So, normally the dependency to the lib from outside of the APEX is satisfied by the stub of the library. But the APEX doesn\u0027t exist in the master or master-art branch. In that case, we have to install it to the platform, otherwise, we will experience runtime error.\n\nSee the build error for PS3 where this fixup doesn\u0027t exist.",
      "parentUuid": "bcf27b05_448cb00e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 883,
        "startChar": 58,
        "endLine": 884,
        "endChar": 42
      },
