        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-22T06:57:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a good point. But I think that\u0027s stricter than necessary. I don\u0027t want to bother unless that violator is actually installed.\n\nFor example, \"abb\" and \"dexdump\" are such violators. They are marked as available to platform for SDK purpose, but they depend on some libraries that are not available to platform.",
