      "writtenOn": "2020-04-23T01:26:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ok, SDK seems to be a wrong example.\n\nframework-all (available only to platform) -\u003e ike-internal (available only to the ipsec apex) is another instance. framework-all doesn\u0027t actually installed to the platform; it\u0027s a build-only artifact. but we are specifying apex_available to prevent accidental inclusion of the library in any apex.",
      "parentUuid": "6d77b667_b23e357a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 890,
        "startChar": 40,
        "endLine": 890,
        "endChar": 82
